// examples/gallery.cpp — generate PNGs for all matplotlib-equivalent plot types
//
// Produces one PNG per plot type in the output directory (default: gallery/volcano/).
// Each PNG is 800x600 with a white background and basic styling.
// The corresponding matplotlib PNGs are generated by scripts/matplotlib_gallery.py.
